{"conversation":"sochi","question":"What freq is Sochi tower?","reply":{"answer":"Sochi tower frequencies are 127.0 MHz VHF and 256.0 MHz UHF.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#sims-title","/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#sims-title","title":"Sochi International Airport · Sim maps"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","title":"Sochi-Adler · DCS: Caucasus"}]},"ms":992,"passed":true,"revision":"16ce32407976faa1f21d7ac3c205a6ce19be891c"}
{"conversation":"sochi","question":"Does it have a TACAN?","reply":{"answer":"The supplied material for Sochi International Airport (represented as Sochi-Adler in DCS: Caucasus) lists an NDB with marker (CO) and an ILS on runway 06, 111.1 MHz (ISO), but does not list a TACAN.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#sims-title","/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#sims-title","title":"Sochi International Airport · Sim maps"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","title":"Sochi-Adler · DCS: Caucasus"}]},"ms":1508,"passed":true,"revision":"16ce32407976faa1f21d7ac3c205a6ce19be891c"}
{"conversation":"sochi","question":"What about ILS?","reply":{"answer":"In DCS: Caucasus, there is an ILS on runway 06 at 111.1 MHz (ISO).","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#facilities-title"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","title":"Sochi-Adler · DCS: Caucasus"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#facilities-title","title":"Sochi International Airport · Runways and facilities"}]},"ms":992,"passed":true,"revision":"16ce32407976faa1f21d7ac3c205a6ce19be891c"}
{"conversation":"sochi","question":"What runways are available?","reply":{"answer":"At the real Sochi International Airport, the available runways are 06/24 and 02/20. In the DCS: Caucasus sim map, only runway 06/24 is represented.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/","/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#sims-title","/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/","title":"Sochi International Airport"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/#sims-title","title":"Sochi International Airport · Sim maps"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","title":"Sochi-Adler · DCS: Caucasus"}]},"ms":932,"passed":true,"revision":"16ce32407976faa1f21d7ac3c205a6ce19be891c"}
{"conversation":"table-airfield","question":"What is the tower frequency for Kuweires?","reply":{"answer":"The tower frequencies for Kuweires are VHF 120.5, UHF 251.35, low VHF 39.8, and HF 4.45.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires","title":"Kuweires · DCS: Syria"}]},"ms":1359,"passed":true,"revision":"16ce32407976faa1f21d7ac3c205a6ce19be891c"}
{"conversation":"table-airfield","question":"What runways are available?","reply":{"answer":"The available runways at Kuweires are 10 (095°) / 28 (275°), 6,663 ft.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires","title":"Kuweires · DCS: Syria"}]},"ms":1118,"passed":true,"revision":"16ce32407976faa1f21d7ac3c205a6ce19be891c"}
